              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 12:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abo barwani boona, abaabaire bamanyiire eby'orugamba, baija Heburooni n'omutima gumwe kwemeka Daudi kuba omugabe wa Israeli yoona; kandi n'Abaisraeli abandi boona bakaba baine omutima gumwe gw'okwemeka Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamarayo kashatu bari hamwe na Daudi, nibarya nibanywa; ahabw'okuba beene waabo bakaba bababisiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi na bataahi baabo, n'abaarugire Isakaari, Zebuluuni na Nafutaali, baija bareetsire eby'okurya aha ndogoya, aha ngamira, aha nyumbu n'aha nte, eby'okurya bingi, esaano, ebiihuro by'emizaabibu eyomire, viinyo n'amajuta, ente n'entaama; ahabw'okuba omuri Israeli hakaba harimu okushemererwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
